 "findings": [
  "Sonnet 5 sends 62 of the 65 pages with tab to the tab reader; the 3 it misses are 三月通 p109, p110 and p115, holding 7 of the 174 reviewed exercises (96.0% kept).",
  "Two of the misses (p109, p110) are tab read as strum notation: pages about the pick's direction, where the tab shows the strokes. The third (p115) is tab read as a fretboard map.",
  "One page is sent with no tab on it (三月通 p20): a wasted segment call, not a lost exercise.",
  "Kind agreement is 135 of 135, but the review started from these verdicts and 'mixed' covers 86 pages, so it says little; route and marks are the measures to compare models on.",
  "Staff or jianpu stands beside the tab on 30 tab pages — the pages a second reading (#425, #426) could check."
 ],
 "findings_zh": [
  "Sonnet 5 把 65 页有 Tab 的页里的 62 页送进了读谱器；漏掉的 3 页是三月通第 109、110、115 页，上面有 174 条练习中的 7 条（保住 96.0%）。",
  "漏掉的 3 页里，第 109、110 页是把 Tab 看成了扫弦谱（讲拨片方向的页，用 Tab 表示拨弦方向）；第 115 页是把 Tab 看成了指板图。",
  "只有 1 页没有 Tab 却被送去读谱（三月通第 20 页）：多花一次切分调用，不丢练习。",
  "类别 135 页全部一致，但审核是从这些答案出发的，而且 86 页都是 mixed，说明不了什么；比较模型要看送没送对和记号。",
  "30 页 Tab 旁边印了五线谱或简谱——这些页可以用第二种读法来核对（#425、#426）。"
 ]
